<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Beyond Linear Attention: Softmax Transformers 
<br class="ltx_break">Implement In-Context Reinforcement Learning</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
